# wip429: ACCENT / FILL held: the trigs of the selected track that carry that flag blink on the white keys (the others stay lit).
# The "leds" lines are printed, read them: white keys 1, 5, 9 = trigs; step 5 has FILL, step 9 has ACCENT.
wait 300
tap EDIT
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
key b9 down
tapkey w4
key b9 up
key b8 down
tapkey w8
key b8 up
# nothing held: all three trigs steady
leds
# FILL held: only step 5 blinks (two phases)
key b9 down
leds
wait 140
leds
wait 140
leds
key b9 up
# ACCENT held: only step 9 blinks
key b8 down
leds
wait 140
leds
wait 140
leds
key b8 up
leds
